// space3d/laser_trail: the glowing wake of a bolt (spawn with `EffectSpawn::at(muzzle)
// .follow(bolt).tint(tier_color)`): a white-hot head riding the bolt and a continuous beam of
// soft glows laid along its path (one per unit of distance, spread over each tick's motion, so
// it stays continuous at 3200 units/s; the ring holds 576, enough up to about 3800 units/s).
// Authored for HDR + bloom: the trail starts at 5× the tint and the head at 8×, so a saturated
// tint (red `(1, 0.1, 0.05)`) keeps its hue in the beam and blooms, while the glows' white
// cores make the hot center line; the head is only a little wider than the beam. The bolt may
// move in any stage (the render node lays the trail on to its render-time pose). When the bolt
// despawns the trail drains and the effect finishes.
ParticleEffect(
    name: "space3d/laser_trail",
    looping: true,
    layers: [
        (
            name: "trail",
            spawn: (rate_per_distance: 1.0),
            lifetime: 0.15,
            size: 4.0,
            color_over_life: (keys: [(0.0, (5.0, 5.0, 5.0, 1.0)), (1.0, (0.6, 0.6, 0.6, 1.0))]),
            alpha_over_life: Preset(Out),
            capacity: Some(576),
            render: (shape: Glow(core: 0.35, hardness: 0.0)),
        ),
        (
            name: "head",
            space: Local,
            spawn: (rate: 60.0),
            lifetime: 0.05,
            size: 6.0,
            color_over_life: (keys: [(0.0, (8.0, 8.0, 8.0, 1.0))]),
            alpha_over_life: Preset(InOut),
            render: (shape: Glow(core: 0.6, hardness: 0.0)),
        ),
    ],
)
